+## Running the tests
+
+```bash
+node tests/run.js
+```
+
+Discovers and runs all `*.test.js` files under `tests/`. Exit 0 = all pass.
+
+Test categories in `tests/`:
+
+- **smoke** — `dom_smoke.js`
+- **failure-mode** — `click_failure_modes.test.js`, `inject_failure_modes.test.js`
+- **resilience** — `resilient_round.test.js`
+- **snapshot-boundary** — `snapshot_boundaries.test.js`
+- **stress** — `stress_simulation.js`
+
 ## 注意
 
 - 这是外部平台控制台方案，不走任何官方 API，所以几乎没有新增成本。
